{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>On the fifteenth day of the second month.</b> This is the month of Iyyar. The dough they brought out of Egypt sufficed them one full month, from the 15th of Nisan until the 15th of Iyyar, and on the night of the 16th they ate from it. On the 16th of Iyyar the manna fell and they ate from it. And the 16th of Iyyar of that year fell on the first day of the week, and this is what is written (Exodus 16): ״ויהי ביום הששי לקטו לחם משנה״ — it was the sixth day of the days of the week and the sixth day of the descent of the manna."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:59:55.975237729Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}